<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 26.2 bln esc, 7.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 26.2 bln esc, 7.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 26.2 billion escudos of eight-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 7.25 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender at the start of a new commercial bank reserve period starting tomorrow.</p>
<p>The rate compared with 7.25 percent previously.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
